  "executive_briefing": "The digital asset market in mid-2026 is defined by a 'Regulatory Flight to Quality,' as the CLARITY Act (H.R. 3633) provides the legal certainty required for Bitcoin to evolve from a static reserve asset into a programmable settlement layer. This legislative breakthrough is enabling institutional-grade smart contracts on Bitcoin, directly challenging Ethereum\u2019s historical EVM dominance. Ethereum remains in a period of 'Narrative Fatigue,' with price action languishing near $1,647 and institutional interest cooling in favor of more regulated BTC exposure. Concurrently, the rise of 'Intent-based' cross-chain protocols like THORChain and Symbiosis is providing the technical plumbing for capital to exit the EVM and enter the burgeoning Bitcoin-native ecosystem without the security risks of legacy bridges.",
